{"action":"hero","hero":{"shot":"shots/wins.js","who":"tane"},"what":"Tane, alone at a dead end, fights off flying security drones with a length of pipe (the drones are NOT in the drawings). The PIPE: a plain straight length of pale steel-grey water pipe about as long as his arm (90 cm) and as thick as his wrist, with one darker threaded coupling ring at its far end; it is exactly the same pipe in every drawing that has it. Drawing 1: cornered but unworried: standing square, feet planted wide, both fists clenched low at his sides, chin down, glaring up from under his brows with his wide grin; both hands EMPTY, no pipe. Drawing 2 (he faces the viewer's RIGHT): he stamps his right geta down hard on the floor in front of him, looking down at it, his right hand open and reaching out low in front of him ready to catch something; both hands EMPTY, no pipe. Drawing 3 (facing RIGHT): the WIND-UP of a huge baseball swing: weight back on his rear leg, knees bent, BOTH hands gripping the pipe's end together, the pipe cocked back behind his right shoulder pointing up and back, chest twisted away from his target, head turned to look ahead to the right at it, teeth bared in a grin. Drawing 4 (facing RIGHT): CONTACT: the swing at full stretch, both arms straight out in front of him gripping the pipe, which points forward and a little up to the right, his weight thrown onto his bent front leg, the rear leg straight behind with its heel up, the coat flaring out behind him. Drawing 5 (facing RIGHT): the FOLLOW-THROUGH: the pipe has swung all the way round and up over his far shoulder, both hands still on it up beside his head, the front leg straight, the back heel lifted, chin up, watching what he hit fly away up to the right, laughing; the coat swirls round his legs. Drawing 6 (seen from in front and from below): ready for the next: standing loose, feet apart, the pipe held low in his RIGHT hand pointing at the floor, his LEFT hand open and half raised, head tipped back to look up at something coming down at him from above, grinning.","loose":true,"float":true,"prop":null,"view":"wins_a","yaw":null,"elev":null,"W":2752,"H":1536,"cols":3,"rows":2,"unit":348,"aspect":"16:9","cels":[{"index":0,"name":"cornered","frame":49,"action":"wins_tane","cel":0,"from":{"yaw":-0.6,"elev":2},"box":[0,0,917,768],"ground":[459.43,689.43],"joints":{"hips":[459.77,385.35],"waist":[459.87,335.72],"chest":[460,273.17],"neckBase":[460.09,229.57],"headBase":[460.13,200.88],"head":[460.28,153.31],"crown":[460.43,105.57],"L.sh":[528.97,242.47],"L.elbow":[566.7,324.59],"L.wrist":[576.94,367.61],"L.hand":[580.79,383.77],"L.hip":[494.76,385.33],"L.knee":[531.91,522.98],"L.ankle":[525.74,663.61],"L.heel":[524.9,687.16],"L.toe":[528.57,702.49],"R.sh":[391.05,242.35],"R.elbow":[350.38,323.27],"R.wrist":[340.36,371.3],"R.hand":[336.6,389.32],"R.hip":[424.74,385.38],"R.knee":[388.2,520.5],"R.ankle":[394.5,650.69],"R.heel":[394.8,673.74],"R.toe":[393.1,688.12]},"face":[0.011,0.096,0.997],"board":false},{"index":1,"name":"stamp","frame":89,"action":"wins_tane","cel":1,"from":{"yaw":-84.2,"elev":2.3},"box":[917,0,1835,768],"ground":[1360.58,682.31],"joints":{"hips":[1361.08,396.19],"waist":[1369.88,346.73],"chest":[1380.96,284.43],"neckBase":[1388.69,241.02],"headBase":[1391.26,212.13],"head":[1404.51,165.64],"crown":[1417.77,119.14],"L.sh":[1401.89,256.19],"L.elbow":[1382.56,336.12],"L.wrist":[1434.98,395.49],"L.hand":[1453.76,416.77],"L.hip":[1364.63,394.64],"L.knee":[1323.85,524.68],"L.ankle":[1246.72,638.41],"L.heel":[1222.13,660.66],"L.toe":[1302.12,674.81],"R.sh":[1370.08,251.27],"R.elbow":[1390.23,306.06],"R.wrist":[1462.27,344.29],"R.hand":[1488.4,358.15],"R.hip":[1357.43,397.78],"R.knee":[1434.59,517.59],"R.ankle":[1464.37,655.98],"R.heel":[1445.14,684.66],"R.toe":[1529.54,678.74]},"face":[0.95,0.272,0.085],"board":false},{"index":2,"name":"windup","frame":99,"action":"wins_tane","cel":2,"from":{"yaw":-84,"elev":2.5},"box":[1835,0,2752,768],"ground":[2327.59,692.38],"joi